        "### 早停機制定義 (Early Stopping Class)\n",
        "\n",
        "* **功能大綱**：定義一個早停類別，用於監控驗證集損失（Validation Loss）。當損失停止改善超過設定的次數時，自動觸發停止訓練，以防止過度擬合（Overfitting）。\n",
        "* **關鍵重點**：\n",
        "    1. **耐心值設定**：透過 `patience` 參數控制模型在停止進步後能容忍的 Epoch 數量。\n",
        "    2. **模型儲存與恢復**：當偵測到更低的驗證損失時，會自動將當前最佳的模型權重儲存至指定路徑（預設為 `best_model.pt`）。\n",
        "    3. **進步判定**：利用 `delta` 參數設定進步的門檻，確保只有顯著的改善才會重置計數器。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 10,
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-01-26T06:24:59.767757Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-01-26T06:24:59.767178Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-01-26T06:24:59.773875Z",
          "shell.execute_reply": "2026-01-26T06:24:59.773144Z",
          "shell.execute_reply.started": "2026-01-26T06:24:59.767728Z"
        },
        "id": "RreSeNF2p6Tp",
        "trusted": true
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class EarlyStopping:\n",
        "    def __init__(self, patience=5, delta=0, path='best_model.pt'):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        Args:\n",
        "            patience (int): 容忍驗證集損失未改善的 Epoch 次數\n",
        "            delta (float): 判定為改善的最小變化量\n",
        "            path (str): 儲存最佳模型的路徑\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        self.patience = patience   # 容忍次數\n",
        "        self.delta = delta         # 最小改善幅度\n",
        "        self.path = path           # 模型儲存路徑\n",
        "        self.counter = 0           # 目前累積未改善的次數\n",
        "        self.best_loss = None      # 紀錄最佳的驗證損失\n",
        "        self.early_stop = False    # 是否觸發早停的標記\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __call__(self, val_loss, model):\n",
        "        # 1. 第一個 Epoch：初始化最佳損失並儲存模型\n",
        "        if self.best_loss is None:\n",
        "            self.best_loss = val_loss\n",
        "            self.save_checkpoint(val_loss, model)\n",
        "        # 2. 判斷是否有進步\n",
        "        elif val_loss < self.best_loss - self.delta:\n",
        "            # 有進步：儲存模型，重置計數器\n",
        "            self.save_checkpoint(val_loss, model)\n",
        "            self.best_loss = val_loss # 存完檔再更新最佳值，這樣 Log 才準\n",
        "            self.counter = 0\n",
        "        # 3. 沒進步\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            self.counter += 1\n",
        "            print(f'EarlyStopping counter: {self.counter} out of {self.patience}')\n",
        "            # 達容忍上限，設定早停標記為 True\n",
        "            if self.counter >= self.patience:\n",
        "                self.early_stop = True\n",
        "\n",
        "    def save_checkpoint(self, val_loss, model):\n",
        "        # 儲存模型權重\n",
        "        print(f'Validation loss decreased ({self.best_loss:.6f} --> {val_loss:.6f}). Saving model...')\n",
        "        torch.save(model.state_dict(), self.path)"
      ]
    },
